WEBVTT

01:05:28.583 --> 01:05:30.184
I don't know what the contrast...

01:05:30.208 --> 01:05:31.476
The radicalized youth

01:05:31.500 --> 01:05:33.559
and indifferent people
who are old like me.

01:05:33.583 --> 01:05:35.559
I want to come out with a unified country

01:05:35.583 --> 01:05:38.059
that understands that the costs
that we owe are big,

01:05:38.083 --> 01:05:40.417
and our pockets
are deep enough to match it.

01:05:42.750 --> 01:05:44.268
CA: Wow.

01:05:44.292 --> 01:05:47.208
Thank you to each of you
for extraordinary eloquence.

01:05:47.958 --> 01:05:49.792
Really, so powerful.

01:05:51.125 --> 01:05:53.518
This conversation, obviously, continues,

01:05:53.542 --> 01:05:55.601
I know that there's many people listening,

01:05:55.625 --> 01:05:57.559
you have other questions,

01:05:57.583 --> 01:06:01.893
this, I think, from TED's point of view
is just the start of the conversation.